; ACCEPTED: comments and blanks. Candle sends
; comments unstripped;
; the firmware strips them. Nothing moves far:
; a small square.
M5
G90 G0 X0 Y0
G21 G17 G54 G94
; a whole-line comment
(a whole-line comment in parentheses)
G0 X10 Y0 ; to the right
G1 X10 (up) Y10 (and across) 
	G1	X0	Y10	
G1 X0 Y0 (ends the square)
; text that looks like replies, in comments
; only:
G0 X0 Y0 ; ok
G0 X0 Y0 (error:9 is only a comment)
G0 X0 Y0 ; [MSG:Pgm End] ok error:20 ALARM:1
; a comment with a real-time byte in it is
; still a real-time
; command in grbl; the status request below is
; harmless:
G0 X0 Y0 ; ?
; a parenthesis that is never closed ends with
; the line
G0 X5 Y5 (never closed
G0 X0 Y0
M5
G90 G0 X0 Y0
M30
